    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>herdsman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				316
			</span></i>, interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.703
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Myrin.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. προβάτων</span>
			<i>shepherd</i>, interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adj., <i>feeding itself</i> (= Lat. <i>agrestis, non
				pastus</i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φασιανός, χήν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Edict.Diocl.</u>
				4.18
			</span></i> (variant for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγριος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκάς</span>.</div>
